// larperCord — Russian (Русский) interface text.
//
// One entry per line: the English text exactly as it is in the code, then the
// translation:
//
//     "Sign in" "Войти"
//     "Replying to {s}" "Ответ пользователю {s}"
//
// Text that is missing here shows in English. Escapes: \n (new line), \" and \\.
// A long entry can continue on the next line after a trailing \ .
//
// Placeholders ({s}, {d}, {d:.0}...) only matter in text that has them:
//   - copy them exactly as in the English text; they are filled in the same order;
//   - to change the order, write {0}, {1}... instead: {N} is the Nth placeholder
//     of the English text, counting from 0, with its formatting. Don't mix the two;
//   - every value of the English text must appear; {{ and }} are literal braces.
// A translation that breaks these rules shows in English.
//
// The list of texts, what is still missing and a check of this file:
//     python3 tools/i18n_strings.py --lang ru --check
// To try changes without building, copy this file to larpercord/i18n/ru.kdl in the
// settings folder (~/.config on Linux, %APPDATA% on Windows) and restart the app.
//
// Português: o texto em inglês do código como chave, a tradução ao lado; o que
// falta aparece em inglês. As regras dos marcadores {…} estão acima.

" (muted)" " (заглушен)"
" [deaf:srv]" " [звук заглушен:сервер]"
" [deaf]" " [звук заглушен]"
" [mute:srv]" " [микрофон отключен:сервер]"
" [mute]" " [микрофон отключен]"
